        "title": "Income Tax Kya Hai — Kyun Dena Padta Hai",
        "content": "Income tax woh paisa hai jo aapki aamdani (income) se sarkar kat ti hai. Yeh desh\r\nchalane ke liye chanda hai — sadke, hospital, school, defense sab isse chalte hain.\r\nIndia mein income tax direct tax  hai — matlab seedha aapki aamdani se cut hota\r\nhai. Har financial year (April 1 to March 31) mein aapki total income calculate hoti\r\nhai, aur uspe tax lagta hai based on \"slabs\" — jyada income = jyada tax.\r\nStudent ke liye important question:  \"Kya mujhe tax dena padega?\"\r\nAnswer:  Agar aapki annual income ₹2.5 lakh se kam hai (old regime) ya ₹4 lakh se\r\nkam hai (new regime), toh aapko ZERO tax  dena hai. Aur new regime mein Section\r\n87A rebate se ₹12 lakh tak ki taxable income pe bhi tax ZERO ho jata hai — salary\r\n₹12.75 lakh tak (₹75,000 standard deduction ke baad taxable ₹12 lakh) = nil tax.\r\nMost students ki income isse kam hoti hai, toh formally tax nahi dena padta. Lekin\r\nITR file karna still beneficial hai — refund ke liye, loan ke liye, visa ke liye.\r\nIncome Tax Slabs FY 2025-26:\r\nIncome Range (Annual) Old Regime Tax Rate New Regime Tax Rate\r\n0-₹2,50,000 0% 0%\r\n₹2,50,001-₹4,00,000 5% 0%\r\n₹4,00,001-₹5,00,000 5% 5%\r\n₹5,00,001-₹8,00,000 20% 5%\r\n₹8,00,001-₹10,00,000 20% 10%\r\n₹10,00,001-₹12,00,000 30% 10%\r\n₹12,00,001-₹16,00,000 30% 15%\r\n₹16,00,001-₹20,00,000 30% 20%\r\n₹20,00,001-₹24,00,000 30% 25%\r\nAbove ₹24,00,000 30% 30%\r\nNote:  Salary ₹12.75 lakh (₹75,000 standard deduction minus) = taxable ₹12 lakh =\r\nnew regime mein 87A rebate ke baad nil tax.\r\nImportant:  ₹5 lakh tak income pe Section 87A rebate se tax zero ho jata hai (old\r\nregime). New regime mein 87A rebate se ₹12 lakh tak ki taxable income pe ZERO\r\ntax (FY 2025-26 se). Student  ki  salary  ₹25,000/month  =  ₹3  lakh/year  =\r\neffectively zero tax. Lekin ITR file zaroor karo!\r\nMarginal Relief Note:  Agar taxable income ₹12 lakh se thoda zyada hai (jaise\r\n₹12.1L-₹12.3L zone), toh bhi ghabrane ki baat nahi. Marginal relief se aapka tax\r\npayable ₹12 lakh se upar wali income se zyada nahi hoga. Matlab ₹12.1L pe tax\r\nsirf ₹10,000 tak simit rahega — ₹61,500 ka poora slab tax nahi lagta.",
