        "title": "ITR Filing — Kyun Aur Kaise",
        "content": "ITR (Income Tax Return) woh form hai jo aap sarkar ko apni annual income aur tax ki\r\ndetail dene ke liye bharte hain. Agar aapki income taxable limit se kam hai toh bhi\r\nITR file karna beneficial hai.\r\n4 Reasons to File ITR Even with Zero Tax:\r\nTax refund claim karne ke liye  — agar TDS cut hua hai aur income\r\ntaxable nahi, toh refund milega. ₹2,000 TDS = ₹2,000 refund.\r\nLoan  approval  ke  liye  —  bank  ITR  dekhti  hai.  Home  loan,  car  loan,\r\npersonal loan — ITR = income proof.\r\nVisa ke liye  — foreign travel mein ITR proof chahiye. US, UK, Schengen —\r\nsab ITR maangte hain.\r\nFinancial record ke liye  — official income history. Future mein business\r\nstart karna ho toh ITR useful.\r\nITR Filing Process — 7 Steps:\r\nStep 1: Go to incometax.gov.in (official website).\r\nStep 2: Register with PAN (already registered hoga agar pehle kiya hai).\r\nStep 3: Select ITR-1 (for salary income) ya ITR-2 (for capital gains).\r\nStep 4: Fill income details from Form\r\nStep 5: Claim deductions under 80C, 80D, 80E etc.\r\nStep 6: Verify tax calculation — payable ya refund.\r\nStep 7: Verify with Aadhaar OTP ya digital signature. Submit!\r\nFree hai — kisi CA ki zaroorat nahi simple salary walo ko.  Time:  15-30\r\nminutes.\r\nDeadline:  July 31 of every year (for previous financial year). Late filing = ₹1,000-\r\n₹5,000 penalty.\r\nITR-1 vs ITR-2 vs ITR-3:\r\nITR-1 (Sahaj):  Salary + one house property + other sources (interest). Most\r\nstudents/freshers.\r\nITR-2:  Capital gains (SIP, stocks), multiple house property. Agar equity sell\r\nkiya ho.\r\nITR-3:  Business/profession income. Freelancers, business owners.\r\nITR-4 (Sugam):  Presumptive income. Freelancers with 44ADA.\r\nCommon ITR Mistakes:\r\nWrong ITR form select karna.\r\nTDS mismatch — Form 16 vs Form 26AS.\r\nDeductions overclaim karna — fake 80C receipts.\r\nBank interest declare nahi karna — AI se pakde jaoge.\r\nVerify nahi karna — ITR file hua hi nahi!",
        "color": "#2563eb",
